{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12225390","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225390","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1222539001:0":{"text":"거기 너희들! 이리 와 봐!","source_cn":"你们几个，过来！过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD21E44B1A41FFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222539002:1":{"text":"크하하하! 역시 내 친구들답군. 꽉 끌어안아 주고 싶다니까!","source_cn":"嚯哈哈哈哈！不愧是我的朋友，让我给你们一个拥抱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B00F373C21143CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222539003:1":{"text":"잠깐, 잠깐. 갑자기 무슨 일인데?","source_cn":"慢着慢着，好端端的，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01238998B4C23975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222539004:1":{"text":"소니아가 알려줬어. 내가 심혈을 기울여 만든 아이들을 데리고 악마와 한판 붙으러 간다지?","source_cn":"索尼娅告诉我了，让我带这些精心打造的孩子去和恶魔打一场。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCCCC97088083A63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222539005:0":{"text":"죽음의 함대와의 결전 후로 좀 더 실력을 보여주고 싶었는데, 별다른 기회가 없었잖아.","source_cn":"和死潮舰队决战之后，他们闹着要再展示展示身手，可根本没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC358D24D9E6CF1EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222539006:0":{"text":"그런데 악마를 상대로 시험 사격을 할 기회가 하늘에서 뚝 떨어질 줄이야! 누가 생각해 낸 건지, 녀석은 천재야!","source_cn":"谁能想到，用恶魔试炮的机会竟然从天而降！不管是谁提出的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EBEA74C0FFF4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1222539006":{"text":"그런데 악마를 상대로 시험 사격을 할 기회가 하늘에서 뚝 떨어질 줄이야! 누가 생각해 낸 건지, 녀석은 천재야!","source_cn":"谁能想到，用恶魔试炮的机会竟然从天而降！不管是谁提出的想法，那个人真是天才！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EBEA74C0FFF4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222539009:0":{"text":"물건은 준비됐어? 배에 다 실은 거야?","source_cn":"东西准备得怎么样？我看已经在装船了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E60CC4547FBFE3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222539010:1":{"text":"대포는 준비됐고, 탄약 상자가 아직이야.","source_cn":"火炮都就位了，还差几箱弹药。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBD0F3BEC2B18331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222539011:0":{"text":"어이, 블러디 로즈 친구! 손이 너무 느린 거 아냐?","source_cn":"这几个血薇帮的小兄弟，手脚不麻利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4335CCA6943E736","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222539012:0":{"text":"윽, 조금 전에는 조심히 옮기라면서요?","source_cn":"呃，之前是你说，装箱搬运时要小心点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x672975D87042AA15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222539013:0":{"text":"당연히 조심해야지! 화약심지에 습기가 찰 수도 있고, 잘못 부딪히다 불꽃이 튀면 폭발할 수도 있으니까.","source_cn":"当然要小心！火药引信有可能受潮，你们要是毛手毛脚的磕了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE2BF319AFC1F9C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222539014:1":{"text":"그러면 이 배에 있는 보물들은 전부 물고기 밥이 되고 말 거라고!","source_cn":"那这一船的好宝贝就都要葬身水底了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA61241B8763FF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222539015:1":{"text":"그... 그래서 대체 뭘 어떻게 하라는 거예요?!","source_cn":"这……不能既要又要呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x999B6C6C1C22264B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222539016:0":{"text":"우리도 도울게요. 얼른 정리하고 드림 아일랜드에 있는 악마를 처리하러 가야 해요!","source_cn":"我们也来帮忙吧，赶快收拾妥当，就可以去对付藏梦岛的恶魔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89AB20A61EBC7BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222539017:1":{"text":"맞아요. 울머스 할아버지는 오래 버틸 수 없어요. 이제 나머지는 우리에게 맡겨주세요!","source_cn":"是呀，奥曼斯的状况不能久等，剩下的就交给我们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01852EF00EB9DD7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"소니아가 생각한 거야","source_cn":"其实是索尼娅的主意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8F408A4EF2EADB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"소니아가 생각한 거야","female":"소니아가 생각한 거야","variant_male_record_index":"66750","variant_female_record_index":"66751","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222539007:0":{"text":"뭐? 그럼 좀 더 남아서 그녀의 사무실 환기 시스템을 뜯어 고쳐줘야겠군.","source_cn":"真的？那我就多留一阵，给她改造改造话事处通风系统吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B52161BAA886322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222539008:0":{"text":"어쨌든 전부 다 너희가 악마의 소식을 가져다준 덕분이지! 크하하하하!","source_cn":"说来说去，也得感谢你们带来了恶魔的消息！嚯哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDEDBD716AD340D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"맞아, 난 천재야!","source_cn":"我是天才，没错！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x59454D3E1A727968","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아, 난 천재야!","female":"맞아, 난 천재야!","variant_male_record_index":"66752","variant_female_record_index":"66753","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"sp